; PENDING-DIAGNOSTIC [INFO] PENDING-WITNESS-GUARD: completion witness is evaluated only while pending goal 59 is active
; PENDING-DIAGNOSTIC [INFO] PENDING-RELEASE-GUARD: release is evaluated only after completion goal 60 is reached
; PENDING-DIAGNOSTIC [INFO] PENDING-ACTION-WITNESS-SEPARATE: action 'train' is not treated as completion evidence; witness 'unit-type-count' owns completion
; PENDING-DIAGNOSTIC [INFO] PENDING-RELEASE-SEPARATE: release remains separate from witness 'unit-type-count' and may clear the demand only from complete state
; Issuance failure: counter-castle-camels | RETAIN-ACTIVE
; An unsatisfied issuance guard leaves demand-counter-castle-camels in ACTIVE; it is not PENDING.
